      "value": "@{5ab3ad272b67505f726c2a8f|full_name}: Yeah I mostly agree with you, just suggestions.\n- The neck fix also makes the bends look horrendous, are you deleting the neck vertex group/weight paint? That breaks the neck, I'd recommend to just vertex weight mix the head with the neck. Haven't had any issues with neck bends using this method personally.",
