      "value": "@{5a6ffbd6337de65dbe2d92a1|full_name}: With the weights mixed would that not potentially still cause clipping for example if you lie down? I got so angry at the clipping while sitting or lying down that Im pretty sure I just removed the neck vertex group after merging the weights to the head. \n\nThe neck breaking is more pronounced when you roll your head in regular vr through so I always have a fbt version and a normal version for when im not in fbt.",
      "viewerReactions": null
